cs\nthat didn't appear on the operator annunciator; **if the boat→operator\n`/diagnostics` relay is dropping boat-side entries, #274 and this issue share a\nsingle root cause.** Check the relay first.\n\n## Acceptance\n- During a live session the boat Starlink tile reflects `starlink.bizzy`, and the\n  operator can distinguish boat vs operator Starlink status at a glance.\n\nSource: 2026-06-12 Massabesic shakedown debrief (operator-UX quick win E3).\n\n---\n**Authored-By**: `Claude Code Agent`\n**Model**: `Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context)`","files":null}]}